{
  "$comment": "Fichier généré par scripts/build-brand.mjs depuis brand.config.json — ne pas modifier à la main.",
  "defaultLanguage": "fr",
  "welcome": {
    "fr": {
      "subject": "Bienvenue sur Cinepisode 🎬",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no, date=no, address=no, email=no\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"dark\">\n<title>Bienvenue sur Cinepisode 🎬</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:dark;supported-color-schemes:dark}\nbody{margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse}\na{color:#5cc8ff}\n@media only screen and (max-width:620px){\n  .wl-card{padding:28px 22px 26px !important}\n  .wl-h1{font-size:22px !important;line-height:30px !important}\n  .wl-code{font-size:26px !important;letter-spacing:6px !important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#0a0a0c;\" bgcolor=\"#0a0a0c\">\n<div style=\"display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Ce que Cinepisode fait pour toi, en trois lignes.&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#0a0a0c\" style=\"background-color:#0a0a0c;width:100%;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 12px 40px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 6px 22px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td width=\"30\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#5cc8ff\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;background-color:#5cc8ff;border-radius:9px;color:#06070a;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:30px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\">&#9654;&#65038;</td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left:10px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:30px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#ffffff;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\">cin<span style=\"color:#5cc8ff;\">episode</span></td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"wl-card\" bgcolor=\"#101013\" style=\"background-color:#101013;border:1px solid #26262c;border-radius:20px;padding:36px 38px 32px;\">\n<h1 class=\"wl-h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:25px;line-height:33px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.3px;color:#ffffff;\">Bienvenue sur Cinepisode&nbsp;!</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#f0f0f0;\">Merci de t'être inscrit·e. Cinepisode garde au même endroit tes films, séries et anime&nbsp;: où tu en es, les nouveaux épisodes, et ta liste synchronisée sur tous tes appareils. Gratuit, sans pub, sans pistage.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#f0f0f0;\"><strong style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;\">Le plus pratique&nbsp;: l'extension Chrome.</strong> Elle détecte ce que tu regardes sur Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll, Disney+ et Apple TV, et te propose de l'ajouter. Tu n'as plus rien à cocher à la main.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0 24px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#5cc8ff\" style=\"background-color:#5cc8ff;border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"{{EXT_URL}}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#06070a;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Installer l'extension Chrome</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#f0f0f0;\"><strong style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;\">Astuce&nbsp;: récupère ton historique.</strong> Depuis l'extension (Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll) ou avec un fichier d'export, ton historique arrive dans l'onglet «&nbsp;Détectés&nbsp;». Tu valides chaque titre, rien n'est ajouté sans toi.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#9a9aa3;\">Une question, une idée, un bug&nbsp;? Réponds simplement à cet email ou écris à <a style=\"color:#5cc8ff;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"mailto:contact@cinepisode.com\">contact@cinepisode.com</a>. C'est moi qui lis.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0 24px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#5cc8ff\" style=\"background-color:#5cc8ff;border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"{{APP_URL}}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#06070a;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Ouvrir Cinepisode</a></td></tr></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 18px 0;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#5c5c66;\">\n            Tu reçois cet email suite à une action sur un compte Cinepisode.<br>\n            Cinepisode · Ton suivi de films, séries et anime<br>\n            Une question ? <a href=\"mailto:contact@cinepisode.com\" style=\"color:#9a9aa3;text-decoration:underline;\">contact@cinepisode.com</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "text": "Bienvenue sur Cinepisode !\n\nMerci de t'être inscrit·e. Cinepisode garde au même endroit tes films, séries et anime : où tu en es, les nouveaux épisodes, et ta liste synchronisée sur tous tes appareils. Gratuit, sans pub, sans pistage.\n\nLe plus pratique : l'extension Chrome. Elle détecte ce que tu regardes sur Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll, Disney+ et Apple TV, et te propose de l'ajouter. Tu n'as plus rien à cocher à la main.\n\nInstaller l'extension Chrome : {{EXT_URL}}\n\nAstuce : récupère ton historique. Depuis l'extension (Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll) ou avec un fichier d'export, ton historique arrive dans l'onglet « Détectés ». Tu valides chaque titre, rien n'est ajouté sans toi.\n\nUne question, une idée, un bug ? Réponds simplement à cet email ou écris à contact@cinepisode.com. C'est moi qui lis.\n\nOuvrir Cinepisode : {{APP_URL}}\n"
    },
    "en": {
      "subject": "Welcome to Cinepisode 🎬",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no, date=no, address=no, email=no\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"dark\">\n<title>Welcome to Cinepisode 🎬</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:dark;supported-color-schemes:dark}\nbody{margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse}\na{color:#5cc8ff}\n@media only screen and (max-width:620px){\n  .wl-card{padding:28px 22px 26px !important}\n  .wl-h1{font-size:22px !important;line-height:30px !important}\n  .wl-code{font-size:26px !important;letter-spacing:6px !important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#0a0a0c;\" bgcolor=\"#0a0a0c\">\n<div style=\"display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">What Cinepisode does for you, in three lines.&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#0a0a0c\" style=\"background-color:#0a0a0c;width:100%;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 12px 40px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 6px 22px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td width=\"30\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#5cc8ff\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;background-color:#5cc8ff;border-radius:9px;color:#06070a;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:30px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\">&#9654;&#65038;</td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left:10px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:30px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#ffffff;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\">cin<span style=\"color:#5cc8ff;\">episode</span></td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"wl-card\" bgcolor=\"#101013\" style=\"background-color:#101013;border:1px solid #26262c;border-radius:20px;padding:36px 38px 32px;\">\n<h1 class=\"wl-h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:25px;line-height:33px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.3px;color:#ffffff;\">Welcome to Cinepisode!</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#f0f0f0;\">Thanks for signing up. Cinepisode keeps your movies, shows and anime in one place: where you're at, new episodes, and your list synced across all your devices. Free, no ads, no tracking.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#f0f0f0;\"><strong style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;\">The handiest part: the Chrome extension.</strong> It detects what you watch on Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll, Disney+ and Apple TV and offers to add it. No more ticking things off by hand.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0 24px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#5cc8ff\" style=\"background-color:#5cc8ff;border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"{{EXT_URL}}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#06070a;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Install the Chrome extension</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#f0f0f0;\"><strong style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;\">Tip: bring your history.</strong> From the extension (Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll) or with an export file, your history lands in the \"Detected\" tab. You confirm each title, nothing is added without you.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#9a9aa3;\">A question, an idea, a bug? Just reply to this email or write to <a style=\"color:#5cc8ff;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"mailto:contact@cinepisode.com\">contact@cinepisode.com</a>. I read everything.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0 24px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#5cc8ff\" style=\"background-color:#5cc8ff;border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"{{APP_URL}}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#06070a;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Open Cinepisode</a></td></tr></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 18px 0;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#5c5c66;\">\n            You're receiving this email because of an action on a Cinepisode account.<br>\n            Cinepisode · Your movie, series and anime tracker<br>\n            Questions? <a href=\"mailto:contact@cinepisode.com\" style=\"color:#9a9aa3;text-decoration:underline;\">contact@cinepisode.com</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "text": "Welcome to Cinepisode!\n\nThanks for signing up. Cinepisode keeps your movies, shows and anime in one place: where you're at, new episodes, and your list synced across all your devices. Free, no ads, no tracking.\n\nThe handiest part: the Chrome extension. It detects what you watch on Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll, Disney+ and Apple TV and offers to add it. No more ticking things off by hand.\n\nInstall the Chrome extension : {{EXT_URL}}\n\nTip: bring your history. From the extension (Netflix, Prime Video, Crunchyroll) or with an export file, your history lands in the \"Detected\" tab. You confirm each title, nothing is added without you.\n\nA question, an idea, a bug? Just reply to this email or write to contact@cinepisode.com. I read everything.\n\nOpen Cinepisode : {{APP_URL}}\n"
    }
  }
